# Spymaster's Vault enters untapped because Bot1 controls a Swamp. Lightning Bolt kills Bot2's Llanowar Elves, so
# {B}, {T}: the Ornithopter connives 1: draw a card, discard the Mox Pearl, and the nonland discard puts a +1/+1 counter
# on it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Spymaster's Vault
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Plains
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

